THE DATA IS NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENCE

The survey data in data/ is derived from the Comparative Study of Electoral
Systems, which sets its own terms. It must be cited as:

    The Comparative Study of Electoral Systems (www.cses.org). CSES MODULE 6
    SECOND ADVANCE RELEASE [dataset and documentation]. December 16, 2025
    version. doi:10.7804/cses.module6.2025-12-16

data/world.csv is derived from World Bank Open Data.
